</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Regardless of our social ranks,</l><l>Our races and nationalities,</l><l>As we were baptized in such a Spirit,</l><l>We should all be the Body of Christ.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The sphere and element the Spirit is,</l><l>And of Christ the reality;</l><l>Christ is the life and constituent</l><l>Constituent of this Body.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The sphere and element the Spirit is;</l><l>It is in this one Spirit</l><l>That we were all baptized into</l><l>This one living Body to express Christ.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
